" end="01:15.334">lake</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.719" end="01:21.910"><span begin="01:15.719" end="01:15.990">It </span><span begin="01:15.990" end="01:16.262">might </span><span begin="01:16.262" end="01:16.582">not </span><span begin="01:16.582" end="01:16.951">feel </span><span begin="01:16.951" end="01:17.943">real </span><span begin="01:17.943" end="01:18.198">but </span><span begin="01:18.198" end="01:18.567">it's </span><span begin="01:18.567" end="01:21.095">okay </span><span begin="01:21.095" end="01:21.910">mm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.198" end="01:26.006"><span begin="01:22.198" end="01:22.423">'Cause </span><span begin="01:22.423" end="01:22.630">that's </span><span begin="01:22.630" end="01:22.950">just </span><span begin="01:22.950" end="01:23.222">the </span><span begin="01:23.222" end="01:24.182">way </span><span begin="01:24.182" end="01:25.143">life </span><span begin="01:25.143" end="01:26.006">goes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.278" end="01:29.943"><span begin="01:26.278" end="01:26.534">I </span><span begin="01:26.534" end="01:26.838">push </span><span begin="01:26.838" end="01:27.222">my </span><span begin="01:27.222" end="01:28.150">luck </span><span begin="01:28.150" end="01:29.209">it </span><span begin="01:29.209" end="01:29.943">shows</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.471" end="01:36.178"><span begin="01:30.471" end="01:31.079">Thankful </span><span begin="01:31.079" end="01:31.382">you </span><span begin="01:31.382" end="01:32.407">don't </span><span begin="01:32.407" end="01:33.462">send </span><span begin="01:33.462" end="01:34.230">someone </span><span begin="01:34.230" end="01:34.535">to </span><span begin="01:34.535" end="01:35.010">kill </span><span begin="01:35.010" end="01:36.178">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.475" end="01:39.554"><span begin="01:37.475" end="01:37.682">I </span><span begin="01:37.682" end="01:37.922">love </span><span begin="01:37.922" end="01:38.306">